# NOTE: persistence/ is deliberately tracked. It ships the read-only demo
# conversations (persistence/results/<user>/<thread>/ referenced by
# persistence/memory/demo_threads.json), the prebuilt SOP RAG index
# (persistence/memory/sop_documents/) and the episodic-memory store. Do not add
# it here — a fresh clone needs those to work.
